<tr><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;background:#f7faf8;font-weight:700;">먼저 수집할 증거/지표</td><td style="padding:10px;border:1px solid #d9e6df;">Raw bytes와 LF 위치, file URI+generation+size, split start/end, current/committed offset, max line/depth, parser/config version, input/output/reject count, queue depth·memory·read/sink rate·latency, sink commit/idempotency log.</td></tr>
